# Token optimization: exclude what an agent doesn't need to read.
# CLAUDE.md points here as the single source of truth for read-exclusion.
# Do NOT restate this list in CLAUDE.md — duplicating it is what makes the two disagree.
# No file/line counts in the comments: they rot.

# Design docs — patterns already captured in CLAUDE.md
docs/

# Standalone demos, not part of the Go build
examples/
h5-demo/

# Build outputs
bin/

# Project internal (AI tooling, CI config, deploy scripts)
scripts/
.github/

# IDE / OS artifacts
.idea/
.vscode/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# protobuf-generated gRPC stubs — patterns captured in CLAUDE.md interface map
pkg/api/

# Checksums / config with no reasoning value
go.sum
.golangci.yml
.env.example
